// The empty option: a `one` axis is on by default and switchable when one
// of its options deploys nothing. `--with
// robot_control=none,alpha.web_commander,alpha.lerobot_recorder` launches
// simulation_mcp without the robots' MCP endpoint and `--with
// world_control=none` without the simulated world's, and `robot_commander=none` runs the physical SO-101
// with no leader, actions driving it.
